    "research2.link_label": "Link:",
    "research2.summary": "The proposed CogVSM framework for deep learning-based video surveillance in smart cities uses an LSTM model to predict object appearance patterns, dynamically manage GPU resources, and reduce memory usage by up to 32.1% compared to the baseline and 8.9% compared to previous methods, achieving a root-mean-square error of 0.795.",
